@echo off`ncolor 0A`necho ========================================`necho  BTS Deploying to GitHub Pages...`necho ========================================`necho.`necho [1/5] Building...`ncall npm run build`nif %0% neq 0 (`n  color 0C`n  echo Build failed!`n  pause`n  exit /b %0%`n)`necho.`necho [2/5] Staging files...`ngit add .`ngit add -f dist`ngit commit -m "Update site build" >nul 2>&1`necho.`necho [3/5] Cleaning up old branch...`ngit branch -D gh-pages-dist >nul 2>&1`necho.`necho [4/5] Splitting subtree...`ngit subtree split --prefix dist -b gh-pages-dist >nul 2>&1`necho.`necho [5/5] Pushing to GitHub Pages...`ngit push origin gh-pages-dist:gh-pages --force`necho.`necho ========================================`necho  Successfully updated!`necho ========================================`n pause
